_stitch_export/
*.zip

# Drizzle
# drizzle/meta/ is deliberately NOT ignored. Drizzle's journal and snapshots are
# the migration history, not build output: without them `db:migrate` cannot run
# on a fresh checkout and `db:generate` has nothing to diff against, so it
# re-emits the whole schema as a duplicate migration. See DECISIONS.md
# (2026-09-02).

stitch_propcompare_residence_concierge
